card.statement:
Let $J=(j_1,\dots, j_m)$ be an $m$-tuple of nonnegative integers such that ${\rm wt}(J) =\beta$. Then $\deg_{\mathcal{F}}(B_J) =m = {\rm ht}(\beta)$ and

\begin{align}
B_J\in F_J +
\sum_{(\lambda,\eta,\gamma,\gamma')\in \mathcal{N}}
G_{-\beta+\lambda+\eta + \gamma}^-U^+_{\theta(-\lambda)-\gamma}K_{-\beta + 2\gamma'}
\end{align}

where $\mathcal{N}$ is the set of four-tuples $(\lambda,\eta,\gamma,\gamma')$ in $Q^+(\pi\setminus \pi_{\theta})\times \mathbb{N}\mathcal{S}\times Q^+(\pi)\times Q^+(\pi)$ satisfying

- $0<\lambda \leq\beta$

- $\eta\leq \lambda$

- $\gamma\leq \beta-\lambda$ and $ \gamma\leq \theta(-\lambda)-\eta$

- $ \gamma'\leq \gamma$
